cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "ecoTrace biogas-sensor pilot, Kiambu County, Kenya: sensor telemetry, gas composition, household survey and derivation code"
abstract: >-
  Sensor telemetry, reference gas-composition measurements and a de-identified
  household survey from a household-biogas monitoring pilot on the ABPL digester
  fleet in Kiambu County, Kenya (2026-01-27 to 2026-07-19), together with the
  code that derives corrected gas flow and methane composition from the raw
  device output. Covers 22 devices, 2,975 device-days and 5,499,810 telemetry
  rows. The deployed firmware crossed the two thermistor ADC channels, so the
  raw flow and composition columns are corrupted; the included derivation code
  undoes the channel swap and recomputes both quantities.
